[00:47.85]She's faced the hardest times you could imagine
[00:57.52]And many times her eyes fought back the tears
[01:08.35]And when her youthful world was about to fall in
[01:16.47]Each time her slonder shoulders
[01:20.34]bore the weight of all her fears
[01:24.58]And a sorrow no one hears
[01:28.64]still rings in mid-night silence in her ears
[01:37.44]
